{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_03_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "a3ed0f4bb6463fb499cd599ae97ce300b4a7f88640c3d4da3a4b359e19e68a5a", "ja": "いいなぁ～。事務所の屋上なんて、古くて狭くて\n暑くて寒くて、ご飯の匂いがするくらい……。はぁ。", "zh": "真好啊～。事务所的屋顶又老又窄，\n又热又冷，甚至还能闻到饭菜的香味……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_03_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "98b0107c69850a899835a2220b68b629e31c812d5df136935be71c92b54e39c0", "ja": "事務所は、雑居ビルですからね……。", "zh": "毕竟事务所是在综合大楼里嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
