{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_350_vd_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_03_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "692d697930d6656ebe0df7965ae4840e097e954bbbc1559faebe5bff835ce5f1", "ja": "えっ？　もうグッズまで作ったんですか？", "zh": "诶？已经连周边都做好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
